  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Stir together Cheddar cheese, salsa, sour cream, cream cheese, and ranch dressing mix in a medium bowl until combined. Spread evenly onto tortillas. Roll up tortillas and chill in the refrigerator until ready to serve.",
